  {
   "type": "cols",
   "layout": "33-66",
   "columns": [
    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "<h1> FAQ </h1>",
      "body": "<p>Frequently asked questions</p>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "top",
      "ftype": "text",
      "id": "c1751",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "accordion",
      "header": "",
      "items": [
       {
        "title": "Which tools can I measure with the ZOLLER »hobCheck«?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The universal »hobCheck« measuring machine can measure and set a wide range of tools such as hobs, taps, end mills, step drills and forming tools.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c1748",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Which gear cutting tools can I measure with the »hobCheck«?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The »hobCheck« offers very accurate measurements that are carried out in accordance with the relevant standards such as DIN 3968 and DIN 1829.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c1746",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "How long does the complete measurement of a tool take?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>A complete measurement of a hob according to DIN 3968 usually only takes a few minutes. The data creation for a new tool is required only once and is also very quick.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c1744",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "What advantages does the integrated probe offer?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The measuring probe makes it possible to measure parameters that remain hidden to the camera, such as the rake angle, the pitch and the flute direction. This is particularly interesting for resharpeners.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c1742",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "How are the measurement results evaluated?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The measurement results are automatically evaluated in accordance with the relevant standards and a specific report with graphics is created.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c1740",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "How does automation work with the »hobCheck«?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The »hobCheck« can be used in combination with the »roboSet 2« automation solution. This allows tools to be loaded, measured, sorted and documented fully automatically - around the clock and without an operator.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c1738",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "What interfaces does the ZOLLER »hobCheck« offer?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The »hobCheck« has open data interfaces to transfer measurement data directly to CAD/CAM systems, grinding machines and tool management software. This allows processes to be digitalized end-to-end.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c1736",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "How are the measurement results documented?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>All measurement results are documented in detail and can be passed on to customers as test reports. This means that the quality of the tools can be fully verified.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c1734",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "What advantages does the »hobCheck« offer for grinding shops?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>For grinding shops, the »hobCheck« enables fully automatic and precise measurement of grinding wheels. This reduces set-up costs and optimizes tool life.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c1732",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "How is the »hobCheck« integrated into production?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>»hobCheck« can be integrated directly into the production processes. This allows tool data to be transferred from CAD/CAM systems and target/actual comparisons to be used for optimized grinding process control.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c1730",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       }
      ],
      "ftype": "accordion",
      "id": "c1750",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ]
